{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18046","headline":"谁氏子 · 韩愈","name":"谁氏子","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"非痴非狂谁氏子，去入王屋称道士。\n白头老母遮门啼，挽断衫袖留不止。\n翠眉新妇年二十，载送还家哭穿市。\n或云欲学吹凤笙，所慕灵妃嫓萧史。\n又云时俗轻寻常，力行险怪取贵仕。\n神僊虽然有传说，知者尽知其妄矣。\n圣君贤相安可欺，乾死穷山竟何俟。\n呜呼余心诚岂弟，愿往敎诲究终始。\n罚一劝百政之经，不从而诛未晚耳。\n谁其友亲能哀怜，写吾此诗持送似。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18046.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18046","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}